        <mxCell id="notation" parent="1" style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=16;" value="UML NOTATION&#10;&#10;+ Public     - Private     # Protected&#10;Class name → Attribute → Method&#10;&#10;Inheritance: solid line, hollow triangle points to the parent class.&#10;Realization: dashed line, hollow triangle points to the interface.&#10;Dependency: dashed line, open arrowhead.&#10;Association: solid line; open arrowhead indicates navigation direction.&#10;&#10;MULTIPLICITY (at association ends)&#10;1: exactly one; 0..1: zero or one.&#10;0..*: zero or many; 1..*: one or many.&#10;Do not show multiplicity on inheritance, realization, or dependency relationships." vertex="1">
